_assets/steam/apps/2372800/extras/063a39e0cef26f63314def330f251b92.mp4?t=1735451917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Threats:</strong> Encounter various threats, from robots to explosive hazards, that require strategic planning and quick reflexes to overcome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Basic Economy:</strong> Manage in-game currency, trade items, and gather resources to help rebuild and survive.</p></li></ul>",
